In article <1991Jun13.205327.28213@rock.concert.net> mcmahan@cs.unca.edu
(Scott McMahan) writes:

>Would someone please tell this poor soul how to get in 
>debug mode (in 3.0 is ^W, ^H, ^E, etc. available at all? 

If you are the game wizard, you can enter wizard mode by using the -D
option for debugging.

Otherwise, you will have to settle with explore mode.  To enter this,
just invoke nethack using the -X option.

>... and I think I have the stronghold working now,
>but in plain explore mode it takes *forever* to get down that far!

Use the wand of wishing for a cursed scroll of teleportation and a ring
of teleport control.

Note: using "X" to enter explore mode will not give you a wand of wishing;
to get one, you will have to start a new game using the -X option.
